Nasher was present during the holographic Council called by a bedridden [[Metz]] to congratulate them on their efforts against the [[Organization]]. {{Source|Coming of Age}}

Nasher alerted the Council after receiving an emergency call from his Agents in [[Tower of Nostradamus]] after they were taken prisoner by [[Wilder]] and his [[Organization]] team. {{source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}

Nasher was later present when [[Focauld Casterwill]] alerted [[Teien Casterwill]] that the [[Blood Spiral]] had found him, a matter Teien brought before the council. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}} Nasher was also present when [[Dante]]'s team came before the council to discuss the Blood Spiral and were tasked with the mission [[Call of the Casterwill]]. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}

Nasher joined the council on the longest night of the year to discuss plans to stop the activation of the [[Spiral Mark]]. {{source|Words from Eathon}} During the final battle at the [[Spiral Mark]], he helped [[Clements]] and [[Billie]]. He stepped in to protect Billie and knocked out a [[Silent Soldier]] who was attacking her. {{source|Dante's Return}}

Following the defeat of [[The Betrayer]], Nasher was seen with the council as they were joined by a new member, [[Dante Vale]]. {{Source|Dante's Return}}
